Now I'm just a freaking maid.

80
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:51,340
Um, Miss Kyouka, when we first met, we
discussed me assisting you out in the field.

81
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:54,854
But I feel like chore work
is all I ever do around here.

82
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:57,937
I will use you in the
field when you're needed.

83
00:04:58,020 --> 00:05:00,917
Until that time, you're free to
concentrate on your housekeeping tasks.

84
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:01,830
Please!

85
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:09,617
I know you can't possibly be stupid enough
to complain about the commander's orders.

86
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:11,600
Her arm turns into a sword!

87
