This is an all-girls dorm.

88
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:18,537
I have no doubt that some of you are
uncomfortable with the male caretaker.

89
00:05:18,620 --> 00:05:22,620
But he's a skilled housekeeper,
and he's essential for my ability.

90
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:25,440
So please, try to treat him kindly.

91
00:05:27,180 --> 00:05:30,160
If he misbehaves or screws up in any way,

92
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:33,222
