155
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:45,919
Still, the whole photo thing
was a misunderstanding.

156
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:49,885
Even if she rats me out to Kyoka,
I could explain my side of it.

157
00:08:50,700 --> 00:08:51,700
