158
00:08:52,100 --> 00:08:53,982
You have to move faster, Himari!

159
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,777
Don't give the enemy a chance to attack!

160
00:08:56,860 --> 00:08:57,690
Right!

161
00:08:58,260 --> 00:09:00,917
