throw them off balance!

163
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:04,950
Be a fan!

164
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:07,760
You must be swift, brutal, and sharp! Ah!

165
00:09:09,580 --> 00:09:11,380
Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!

166
00:09:12,660 --> 00:09:13,490
Ah! Ah!

167
00:09:13,573 --> 00:09:14,403
Ah!

168
00:09:14,486 --> 00:09:15,316
Watch me!

169
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:18,330
Ah!

170
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:26,220
And that's how you perform a combo!

171
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:28,157
Oh, without using your ability!

172
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,677
You're amazing, Commander!

173
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:30,936
