the wrong impression!

176
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:37,697
Uh, oh, hi, Nei.

177
00:09:37,780 --> 00:09:39,839
I have news for you as your senpai.

178
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,280
Sure, I'm listening.

179
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:45,457
The commander Himari and Nei will be
leaving the dorm to attend a meeting,

180
00:09:45,540 --> 00:09:48,157
so keep an eye on things
with Shushu while we're gone.

181
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,440
Alone with Shushu?

182
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,797
Miss Shushu is a really nice person,

183
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:56,174
so I think it'll be a good opportunity
for you to get to know her better.

184
00:09:56,660 --> 00:09:59,800
That is not the face of a nice person.

185
00:10:04,260 --> 00:10:08,760
Fantastic perfect for soothing my muscles
after an intense training session.

186
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:12,717
Why am I letting her walk all over me?

187
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:16,212
Enough's enough I gotta put
my foot down once and for all!

188
00:10:17,940 --> 00:10:21,517
Or I could keep it up for
a little longer I guess

189
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:24,697
Hey how'd you get so
good at giving massages?

190
00:10:24,780 --> 00:10:28,540
Well, I used to give them to my
big sister, so I had practice.

191
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:31,193
So you've got a big sister just like me.

192
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,459
You have siblings?

193
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:34,280
I have two older sisters.

194
00:10:34,460 --> 00:10:35,460
I'm the youngest.

195
00:10:35,980 --> 00:10:39,677
I grew up without a dad, and I've
only attended all-girls schools,

196
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:42,172
so I've never talked to a guy before you.

197
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:44,897
So that's why you
thought I was so strange.

198
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:47,040
I was watching your every move.

199
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:51,697
And then I decided to turn you into my
slave, because it seemed like so much fun!

200
00:10:51,780 --> 00:10:53,637
Do you realize how crazy that sounds?

201
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:58,500
Maybe it does, but in my opinion, having
fun in life is the most important thing.

202
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:00,391
It's why I moved to Mato.

203
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:02,366
I was looking for excitement.

204
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:03,457
That's your reason?

205
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:05,440
Even though you could die? Sure!

206
00:11:05,780 --> 00:11:07,604
Slaying Shuki is a total blast!

207
00:11:07,700 --> 00:11:10,759
It's like I'm the protagonist
of an adventure manga!

208
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:13,780
I feel so much better!

209
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:16,442
Hey, let's play a fighting game!

210
00:11:17,420 --> 00:11:20,577
Okay, but you should know I'm
pretty good at video games.

211
00:11:20,660 --> 00:11:22,217
Then why don't we spice things up?

212
00:11:22,300 --> 00:11:27,300
The loser has to strip off a piece
of their clothing what hold on?

213
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:31,388
Obviously slaves don't have the
right to refuse their master.

214
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:37,377
Fine by me bring it I'll beat her
and then force her to apologize!

215
00:11:37,460 --> 00:11:38,940
K .O.

216
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:41,950
K .O.

217
00:11:43,700 --> 00:11:45,460
K .O. K .O.

218
00:11:48,260 --> 00:11:49,120
You win.

219
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:53,380
You're way too easy to take down.

220
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:57,117
But my friends won't
even let me play as Guile

221
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:59,788
because I always end
up kicking their asses.

222
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,588
Come on, time to get naked.

223
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:04,817
But wait, taking off my
underwear would be a crime.

224
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:06,140
We're here in Mato.

225
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,697
It's not that big a deal.

226
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:08,837
Go ahead, take him off.

227
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:10,957
I gotta say, I've never
seen a guy exposed,

228
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:13,017
so I'm kind of curious to
see what it looks like.

229
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:15,657
But wait, you have to
remember that I'm a man.

230
00:12:15,740 --> 00:12:17,197
What if I start feeling frisky?

231
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,697
It's not safe for you, Shushu.

232
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:19,898
You could get hurt.

233
00:12:20,420 --> 00:12:21,596
Oh, what's not safe?

234
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:25,348
You ought to trust your gut
whenever there's danger involved.

235
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:28,430
Huh?

236
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,577
That's what you were worried about?

237
00:12:32,660 --> 00:12:33,520
How adorable!

238
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:39,100
I'll be just fine.

239
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:41,857
I would never let a man
take advantage of me.

240
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:43,580
I forgot about her ability.

241
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:46,860
You're the one in danger here.

242
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,830
Hey!

243
00:12:50,913 --> 00:12:52,160
Wait a second, Shushu!

244
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,340
No can do!

245
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:56,260
Now that you're incapacitated,

246
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,837
it's time to accept your punishment?

247
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:01,391
and show me what you're hiding underneath.

248
00:13:01,740 --> 00:13:02,570
Shushu!

249
00:13:02,653 --> 00:13:03,800
Your hands are cold!

250
00:13:10,220 --> 00:13:12,437
It's so teeny-weeny and adorable!

251
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,520
That's hilarious!

252
00:13:21,900 --> 00:13:22,730
An attack!

253
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:25,293
And Kyoka and the others are still gone!

254
00:13:27,580 --> 00:13:28,560
The barrier!

255
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,059
You can wait here.

256
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:31,577
I've got this. Uh, hey!

257
00:13:31,660 --> 00:13:33,420
Guys are too wimpy.

258
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:35,228
Be a good boy and stay put.

259
00:13:37,900 --> 00:13:39,697
Overpowering us with your size?

260
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:41,140
Not a bad strategy.

261
00:13:41,740 --> 00:13:44,280
Unfortunately, I've got the upper hand.

262
00:13:44,620 --> 00:13:46,540
Taste my Peach ability!

263
00:13:49,900 --> 00:13:51,100
Paradigm Shaft!

