293
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:29,560
It worked for a second.

294
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,960
If her shirt does a better job...

295
00:16:35,780 --> 00:16:39,000
Oh God, what does this
say about me as a person?

296
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:40,580
This is my life now!

297
00:16:47,580 --> 00:16:49,477
There's no time to be indecisive.

298
